    <section v-if="section==='consultation'" class="kimi-section kimi-wrap kimi-consult-grid"><div class="kimi-card"><h2>Schedule Your Free Consultation</h2><p>A 30-minute conversation about life coaching.</p><KimiConsultationForm v-if="!preview" :packages="packages"/><p v-else>Open the published website to request a consultation.</p></div><aside><div class="kimi-landscape" :style="mountainStyle"><p>A conversation today<br/>can lead to a brighter tomorrow.</p></div><div class="kimi-card kimi-soft"><h2>What to Expect</h2><h3>A Relaxed Conversation</h3><p>We’ll talk about where you are, what you’re looking for, and how I can support you.</p><h3>Explore Your Options</h3><p>Ask about coaching sessions and packages. Counseling inquiries go through Next Level Up.</p><h3>No Pressure</h3><p>Ask questions, get to know each other, and decide whether coaching feels like the right next step.</p><router-link class="kimi-text-link" :to="path('contact')">Have a question first? Contact Kimi →</router-link></div></aside></section>

